{"id":"c0f7e0689a5b99e0","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-prop-axiom-definition.md","title":"Axiom Characterization","display":"prop-axiom-definition — Axiom Characterization","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-axiom-definition","aliases":["58-prop-axiom-definition"],"display":"prop-axiom-definition — Axiom Characterization","depends_on":["[[58-df-formula]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-theory.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-axiom-definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-axiom-definition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-axiom-definition — Axiom Characterization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90ce6acf0c65af45\" href=\"?note=90ce6acf0c65af45\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-theory.md\">../batch08/58-df-theory.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,T,\\varphi\\in V\">\\(\\Sigma,T,\\varphi\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>-公式集合，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)\\)</span>（自由变量集合，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}(T,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Theory}(T,\\Sigma)\\)</span>（带语言参数的理论谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"90ce6acf0c65af45\" href=\"?note=90ce6acf0c65af45\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-theory.md\">../batch08/58-df-theory.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AxiomOf}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{AxiomOf}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>-理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的公理”谓词，定义于此）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}definition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AxiomOf}_S(\\varphi,T,\\Sigma)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Theory}(T,\\Sigma)\n\\land\\varphi\\in T\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}definition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AxiomOf}_S(\\varphi,T,\\Sigma)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Theory}(T,\\Sigma)\n\\land\\varphi\\in T\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>句子是自由变量集为空的一阶公式；本命题不再引用上游未定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 是谓词的显式参数；规范上游 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}\">\\(\\mathrm{Theory}\\)</span> 是二元谓词，不能以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Theory}(T)\\)</span> 调用。</li>\n<li>若采用允许开放公式作为公理模式的约定，则必须另行定义模式及其实例化，不能与单个句子混同。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"90ce6acf0c65af45","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-theory.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)$（$\\Sigma$-公式集合，见 [[58-df-formula]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)$（自由变量集合，见 [[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"90ce6acf0c65af45","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Theory}(T,\\Sigma)$（带语言参数的理论谓词，见 [[../batch08/58-df-theory.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma,T,\\varphi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Theory}(T,\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AxiomOf}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}definition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AxiomOf}_S(\\varphi,T,\\Sigma)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Theory}(T,\\Sigma)\n\\land\\varphi\\in T\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)=\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Theory}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Theory}(T)","display":false}],"bytes":1441,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3931","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-prop-axiom-definition.md|58-prop-axiom-definition]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["65418b505fc53093","715a32e91161b34f","90ce6acf0c65af45"]}